**PROPOSED FOUNDATIONAL RESEARCH PROGRAMME — NO POST-TRANSFORMER SUPERIORITY, LANGUAGE-COMPETENCE, PARAMETER-EFFICIENCY, QUANTUM-ADVANTAGE, NOVELTY OR PUBLICATION CLAIM IS CURRENTLY EARNED.**

